{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "898c93c8d1eb100051e1a46c5c275d74d2549ae57179c3e964424034c2382033", "ja": "逆境でこそ輝く強さを", "zh": "逆境中更显耀眼的坚强", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d1446882f9c25021c86a42172cdb1e7218d4fa3c3bd1e08b784f96c58d3116dd", "ja": "家のことを言われて気にならないといえば嘘\nになるが、全ては自分の実力次第だと静香を\n優しく諭す伊織。自身の力を認めさせたいと\nいう一念で共感した2人は、よりお互いへの\n理解を深めていくのだった。", "zh": "要说完全不在意别人提起家里的事，那是骗人的，\n但伊织温柔地劝导静香，一切都取决于自己的实力。\n怀着想让别人认可自身实力的信念而产生共鸣的2人，\n也因此进一步加深了彼此的了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf502cacc6123995c18e1fcb402d42dcd217cccf4b4f8804e1bad5501fd8699d", "ja": "みんな、すまない。\nここで少し、待っていてくれるか？", "zh": "抱歉，大家。能在这里等我一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "f14f6331ffc2d1a94937d80aca7c4b0d2188d7570124b17c5d8541858f7bdb6b", "ja": "アンタ、静香を探しに行くつもりなんでしょ？\nだったら私も行くわ。", "zh": "你是打算去找静香吧？\n那我也一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3d32760b6827d55451ccd367cec07cf51d27d5d42eb590fc941783b41b39bc98", "ja": "えっ？　でも……。", "zh": "咦？可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "a84b3333f2b65bbac7a2f133ebcdd934784e9313b9cca2fb322d38f5770e6b94", "ja": "静香があんなふうになった原因は、私よ。\nなら、私が行くべきだわ。", "zh": "静香变成那样，原因在我。\n既然如此，我应该去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "8d5f3b8470404d121ad9aaf55947b2383c4834db2278bc5675f3d17d570e196f", "ja": "伊織さん……大丈夫ですか？\nおうちのことって、前にも……。", "zh": "伊织姐……你没事吧？\n家里的事，以前也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "4bb607efcf1598a4b5ca81f2adc2a0922a52f4728c6c5f261dfae0ef3585ae9d", "ja": "ありがと、可奈。私なら平気よ。\nどっちかっていうと、静香のほうが心配だわ。", "zh": "谢谢你，可奈。我没事的。\n真要说的话，静香那边才更让人担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "ee925c28c848c5ab6b58559352013a03e0bad3e14053d1aab0ed5e1a1be06fc2", "ja": "ほら、ぼーっとしてないで。さっさと行くわよ、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "喂，别发呆了。快点走吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7bc2fb78c4ab93dfb2e9ab692dc5774829a1a57a612589c30f782fc78cc8c051", "ja": "……ああ、わかった。\n一緒に行こう。", "zh": "……啊，好。\n一起走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ccea4e699628e5bad3ad36e9b2d6133d39e25e956fb2470a4ce111cdef2c27af", "ja": "（静香を探して、屋上へとやってきた）", "zh": "（为了寻找静香，我来到了屋顶）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f6d1ee53b4c2830405a663891eb1dbb032dff2221e6cdb4cc3f8257f19c66814", "ja": "ここにいたんだな、静香。", "zh": "原来你在这里啊，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "e29c2ab70cf9f4a6f069fa8aa3900160ba7b87069b41e2956f0fd8590174bbb1", "ja": "もう、あちこち探しちゃったじゃない。", "zh": "真是的，我都找了你好多地方了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "d71bf4f5ab87bc4395387d4643c9973a4844454aeb1d1bb7f37945c180126374", "ja": "{$P$}……\n伊織さんも……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n伊织也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "f55ede392518e8f8979a8082365b70e5d625f1a3a0e3965678c103e57ff98588", "ja": "すみません。私のせいで、取材が\n中断してしまって……ご迷惑をお掛けしました。", "zh": "对不起。都怪我，采访才会中断……给您添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d190954bb36961fdeafd8c486c18460249274ff2d1172b8cf0075344aff946a5", "ja": "いや、いいんだ。\nそれより、静香は大丈夫か？", "zh": "没事的，不用放在心上。\n比起这个，静香你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b4a20fa9a0d8718114cc9329bd46e0c813544e410666d162c2eaf00fe770729", "ja": "はい。……あの、私……自分では、\n間違ったこと、言ってないと思ってます！", "zh": "是的……那个，我……我觉得自己并没有说错什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "05d716ceaea92dfd18647b68bdafaa8b759f3d8ff289991558468a9f62791f69", "ja": "私、伊織さんが真摯に役に向き合ってるのを、\nずっと見てきました。だから……！", "zh": "我一直看着伊织认真地面对自己的角色。所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "d2ab9720370ffaf46a719a1a9509322c40089fff0e1d47ff6c230a608431d322", "ja": "気にすることないわよ。この題材に私が出演する。\n{$P$}も、わかってたことでしょ？", "zh": "没什么好在意的。我会出演这部作品。{$P$}也早就知道了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "72fff66ebcf91020143795f913f4791d853dfbaa942dbff4c26bcc97c371be75", "ja": "まあ、多少はな。", "zh": "算是知道一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b27734124a4064ef82ce60d10985d840ec33af7de62ddd4b8b640f4bdbdb913", "ja": "そんな……！", "zh": "怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "838367a660f2a392e07f639d58397375036032ada626de5b9001923e82274931", "ja": "私が水瀬財閥の娘なのは、本当のことだもの。\n好きに言わせておけばいいのよ。", "zh": "我是水瀬财阀的千金，这是事实。\n随他们怎么说好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "24005ca938789953c98f4897ccb6effc6b7d431cf0a54fe39821670fa807ff31", "ja": "でも……だからって、あんまりじゃないですか！", "zh": "可是……就算这样，也太过分了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "b79ad6a3fdc25623ff5116eba006e3d23ccb94a8cebb429b02abbaf40988a1c4", "ja": "そうね……気にならないって言ったら、嘘になるわ。\nでも、いいの。", "zh": "没错……要说一点都不在意，那是在撒谎。\n不过，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "1f261473e15edb67332a6e7971f3133bf0f37f0b2caa98ae3c2119fb28f33777", "ja": "周りが何を言おうと、最終的には、\n伊織ちゃんの実力次第ですもの。", "zh": "不管周围人说什么，归根结底，\n都取决于伊织我自己的实力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "a86393fef4ac6349446b84c8fbfeaeb230298ec75ca7a7662f1817c7279f589e", "ja": "それに、私が本当に嫌な気持ちになるような\n取材だったら……。", "zh": "而且，如果采访真的让我感到很不舒服的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "b6de46a087c616c54c87f893ab7f5d4fc555ca7cbdcbbef5401aa177dbbb236c", "ja": "{$P$}が止めてくれるはずよ。\n今回だって、そうだったでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}应该会阻止我的。\n这次不也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "97b9b1dc60cf8309063160a54fe229bdce27da7d137516b1f447a5e38e9fab9c", "ja": "もちろん。でも俺が止めに入る前に、\n伊織が自分でストップをかけてそうだけどな。", "zh": "当然。不过在我出面阻止之前，伊织估计就会自己喊停了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "3798077cbd25f48e2f8695b529d1b8ba0b5560f5ba0bc3e73192217028325462", "ja": "だから、伊織ちゃんが動く前に止めるのが\nアンタの仕事でしょ！", "zh": "所以，在伊织动手之前拦住她，不就是你的工作吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d6744de71f65d46cb078da4e1a2769513a298676a099e116979b04904dae281e", "ja": "……落ち着いたか？", "zh": "……冷静下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "568b9c2bc5740c7dece630664c4b08e15ac593e0b04b65464d1ea10785e0817d", "ja": "はい。\n……その、改めてすみませんでした。", "zh": "是的。\n……那个，真的很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "73b450300e6137403aa9aeec8aea1995d98db82aa9708111d1335223ce649b49", "ja": "取材を止めたこともそうですけど、\n私が勝手に伊織さんのことで怒ってしまって……。", "zh": "不仅是擅自中止采访的事，\n我还因为伊织小姐的事自顾自地生气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "6ee93eb30338e4cdb7a1d241ba512d6f9a2c80bf74eac5462d49adc9c25b1de3", "ja": "いいのよ。でも、静香がそんなに怒るなんて、\nちょっと意外だったわ。", "zh": "没关系。不过，静香居然会那么生气，倒是有点出乎我的意料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0931941b609d1df8e39dd3ccb92110667f5400cb32e5e3712ac0c5afe085cfe", "ja": "私……伊織さんの努力が、なかったことに\nされてしまったように感じたんです。", "zh": "我……感觉伊织小姐的努力，\n就这样被抹去了一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0c73f5151a47dcdf61c558e3a7a818232f43c71593c4173b0557dcec01aabd6", "ja": "いえ、伊織さんだけじゃないのかもしれません。\n私たちみんな、努力してここにいるので……。", "zh": "不，也许不只是伊织小姐。\n我们大家都是靠自己的努力走到这里的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "adfec6f04677c1fe49705f6480df383040d8ede65dc558bd13681143be35008f", "ja": "そうだな。静香の言うとおりだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我也觉得，正如静香所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5d3e33739405a68ecb2c9d2332ee93b68faedeba5325a96384c5cc01e2df758", "ja": "それをあんなふうに言われたことが、悔しくて。\nけど……。", "zh": "被那样说，我真的很不甘心。\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "033e218dfaf8c5a850589c9a9f5005cec4f9f6bcc583366035849c033e543a29", "ja": "伊織さんを信用していればよかったんですね。\n……本当に、すみませんでした。", "zh": "原来只要相信伊织就好了。\n……真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "13dae69f09d3230276a5694137bceec66b8db528e0fd15c9ee962993237593c7", "ja": "ちょっと、そんなにへこまないでよ。\nそれに、アンタの気持ち、ちょっとうれしかったわ。", "zh": "喂，别这么垂头丧气的。\n而且，你的心意也让我有点开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "dfa37aaf38448d32ea5422635c69b3500f3600844be13d4198f59f8af2bcd087", "ja": "伊織さん……。", "zh": "伊织……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "4f70d1f3fd837b254bbacde7de9ac5a2111f9b54d5a3b846b0db61ad862b88d8", "ja": "でも、これだけは覚えておきなさい？\nあの程度で、へこたれる私じゃないって。にひひっ♪", "zh": "不过，这一点你可要记住了哦？我可不是会因为那种程度就被击垮的人。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "ac930b53e57b9c36bfb32478069dc0cad9db587b11b84cc2781a8d7b7dbdc5ec", "ja": "（伊織の「自分を認めさせたい」という気持ちは、\n静香なら痛いほどわかるだろう）", "zh": "（伊织那种“想让别人认可自己”的心情，静香一定能深切地理解吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "6dfc7dd3004fd3bf1b668d15d61dc69baa1f0bd0ccff05f57240e760855350cb", "ja": "ふたりの実力を世間に認めさせるには……\n直近の仕事を、大成功させないといけないな。", "zh": "要让大家认可你们两人的实力……\n最近这份工作必须取得巨大成功才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "6335a10b13c5a657761e3b59e3ad5967b3540db48edc1bf1b91829817213a68c", "ja": "つまりサーフィアとソウヤを、どれだけ\n魅力的に演じられるかにかかっている。", "zh": "也就是说，关键在于能否把萨菲娅和索亚演绎得足够有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "bfc3abc4734efe3fe5617a25b0feb4811b8e0418a510365898f6cfbef55c5933", "ja": "そうね！　私ひとりじゃ、どうにもならないわ。\n静香、力を貸してくれる？", "zh": "没错！光靠我一个人，可什么都做不了。\n静香，你愿意助我一臂之力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "7470d140f6dd9e3e04b42cf6c136847d835372b08ee4de28680e8094a6a10624", "ja": "も、もちろんです！\n私にできることなら、何だって！", "zh": "当、当然可以！\n只要是我能做到的，什么都可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "b38b4401879f054f7b1cf5652b3a4402ac3e3c8210b836185dd470b84bb45f57", "ja": "あれ……今のやりとり、なんだか物語の序盤の\nサーフィアとソウヤみたいだったな。", "zh": "奇怪……刚才那段对话，感觉就像故事开头的\n萨菲亚和苍矢一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "ac4b45f0ada19cb48a6ff886408ff6ae3db4d9654014b72a47969e99d6428b66", "ja": "え？　……言われてみれば、そうね。", "zh": "诶？……听你这么一说，好像确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "661c694236806c280c6dbc3d10b3f4021b2a780634a9d8a3de572ad7de480ab8", "ja": "ふふ。本当に……。", "zh": "呵呵。真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0320_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "522a11c03a6057f80b63df22d064328de6b644ebe522ae9cf2d15d2257481f56", "ja": "（役柄を通じて、伊織と静香はお互いへの\n理解を深めたみたいだ。これからが楽しみだな）", "zh": "（看来伊织和静香通过各自饰演的角色，加深了对彼此的理解。真期待她们今后的发展啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
